# Serve this repo as-is. GitHub Pages otherwise runs Jekyll, which parses every
# .md file through Liquid — and the JSX `style={{ ... }}` snippets in
# docs/progressive-blur.md read as unterminated Liquid variables, failing the
# build. This site is plain HTML/CSS/JS with no Jekyll config, layouts or
# Gemfile, so the build step has nothing to contribute.
#
# Side benefit: files and folders starting with an underscore are no longer
# skipped by Jekyll.
